On Sat, Oct 16, 2010 at 12:37:04AM -0700, mashers wrote:
> So, does anyone have any suggestions for how I can begin to
> reprogramme my brain? 

The way I get in practice when I'm prepping for LogFest is to try to
shift my internal monologue.  That is: when I'm just going around
doing things throughout my day, I try to translate as many random
thoughts as I can into Lojban (or have them in Lojban in the first
place, although that's trickier).

(ta'o I always thought that my thoughts were in English; it turns
out from this exercise that that's only half right, and I can't
really explain the other half :)

-Robin

